# Git 提交信息（Source Control 自动生成）

When Cursor auto-generates a Git commit message for this repository, follow ALL rules below.

## Hard requirements

1. MUST use Conventional Commits: `<type>(<scope>): <subject>`
2. MUST write the subject (and body if any) in Simplified Chinese (简体中文)
3. NEVER write the commit subject entirely in English
4. NEVER use vague subjects: `update`, `fix bug`, `wip`, `misc`, `临时提交`
5. Keep ONE concise subject line (≤72 characters); do NOT end with `。` or `.`
6. Add a short Chinese body ONLY when needed to explain motivation; no file-list dump
7. One commit = one concern; subject should explain WHY, not list filenames
8. Allowed types: feat, fix, docs, style, refactor, perf, test, build, ci, chore, revert
9. Preferred scopes for this repo: `skills`, `doc`（无合适 scope 时可省略）
10. Breaking change: use `type(scope)!: …` and/or a footer `BREAKING CHANGE: …` in Chinese

## Examples (copy the style, not the English)

- feat(skills): 补充 win-acme 静默续期与 IIS 绑定步骤
- fix(skills): 修复续期任务未写入计划程序的问题
- refactor(skills): 收敛证书申请与绑定流程以减少分支
- docs(doc): 补充 DNS-01 验证与防火墙注意事项
- chore: 调整本地忽略规则以排除证书私钥产物

## Wrong vs right

- ❌ `Add win-acme renewal steps.`
- ✅ `feat(skills): 补充 win-acme 静默续期与 IIS 绑定步骤`
- ❌ `fix: update cert bug`
- ✅ `fix(skills): 修复续期任务未写入计划程序的问题`
